271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 974 0 R
/E (The Jooble script retries with exponential backoff on 429 and 5xx errors, and FreeHire on 5xx errors. JSearch logs a warning when the RapidAPI limit is reached and skips that keyword, and Tanqeeb logs failures and moves on.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 975 0 R
/E (HTTP status codes are checked explicitly, and failed requests are skipped instead of stopping the run.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [14]
>>
