/P 135 0 R
/E (During the data ingestion phase, the pipeline encountered rate limit constraints and quota restrictions imposed by external APIs \(such as JSearch and Jooble\). To mitigate potential connection interruptions and prevent exceeding the maximum allowed requests per second or day, intelligent delays and throttling mechanisms were implemented between requests, ensuring a smooth and uninterrupted data collection process.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
