287 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 985 0 R
/E (Merging job postings and skills into one fact table would have caused a fan-out, inflating posting counts by the average number of skills per job. This was resolved with a Fact Constellation: two fact tables \(fct_job_postings, fct_job_skills\) sharing conformed dimensions. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
288 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 986 0 R
/E (Skill name variants were also unified through a skill_synonyms seed, and missing values in key fields were preserved using an Unknown Member pattern instead of being dropped.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
289 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (7.3 PIPELINE ORCHESTRATION CHALLENGES)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
290 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 135 0 R
/T (Two operational issues were encountered when automating the pipeline with Prefect. First, Prefect could not access our GitHub repository by default, as the pipeline code is hosted in a private repository; this was resolved by generating a GitHub personal access token and configuring Prefect with the required permissions. Second, the pipeline code was originally structured to run from a local file path on a single machine, which is not compatible with automated, repeatable execution. This was resolved by configuring the Prefect flow to pull the pipeline code directly from the GitHub repository at runtime, decoupling execution from any single local environment.)
/E (Two operational issues were encountered when automating the pipeline with Prefect. First, Prefect could not access our GitHub repository by default, as the pipeline code is hosted in a private repository; this was resolved by generating a GitHub personal access token and configuring Prefect with the required permissions. Second, the pipeline code was originally structured to run from a local file path on a single machine, which is not compatible with automated, repeatable execution. This was resolved by configuring the Prefect flow to pull the pipeline code directly from the GitHub repository at runtime, decoupling execution from any single local environment.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
