/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (Each of the four live sources \(Jooble, JSearch, FreeHire, Tanqeeb\) has a dedicated Python extractor that retries automatically on transient failures. Extracted files are uploaded as JSON to Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2, partitioned by source and ingestion date. TapNeo is the exception to this path: as a one-time historical file rather than a live source, it was loaded directly into the raw layer without passing through this extraction)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
