>>
endobj
303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (New files are loaded from the data lake into source-specific RAW tables in Snowflake using a COPY INTO operation. Snowflake tracks previously loaded files at the storage-integration level, so re-running this load step does not reprocess or duplicate files already ingested.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
