305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (The initial data preprocessing pipeline performs several core operations. It begins with advanced filtering and non-tech removal by inspecting job titles and descriptions to ensure they are legitimate tech roles, filtering non-tech engineering fields \(such as civil or architectural engineering that may occasionally appear by mistake\). Following this, it handles extraction and parsing by automatically extracting and mapping technical skills \(such as Python, SQL, React, AWS, Docker, etc.\) from unstructured descriptions using extensive keyword dictionaries and Regular Expressions, alongside extracting educational requirements where available.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
