/E (Following the ingestion, cleaning, standardization, deduplication, and validation stages, the pipeline produced a final curated dataset for the Saudi technical job market. The resulting data represents a structured and consistent version of job postings collected from multiple sources and is prepared for downstream analytics and applications.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
522 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (The final dataset was generated on September 27, 2026 and consists of seven curated mart tables. These tables provide job-level information together with supporting information about technical skills, companies, locations, job attributes, and dates.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
523 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 149 0 R
/E (The final curated dataset contains 1,331 unique job postings, 707 companies, 15 locations, and 723 distinct technical skills. In addition, the FCT_JOB_SKILLS table contains 7,883 job-skill relationships, representing the association between job postings and the technical skills extracted from their descriptions.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
524 0 obj
<<
