/P 155 0 R
/E (Overall, the pipeline transformed fragmented job-posting data from multiple sources into a curated and reusable analytical dataset. The resulting dataset contains 1,331 unique job postings, 707 companies, 15 locations, 723 distinct technical skills, and 7,883  job-skill relationships. )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
