2000 0 obj
<<
/Title (Two operational issues were encountered when automating the pipeline with Prefect. First, Prefect could not access our GitHub repository by default, as the pipeline code is hosted in a private repository; this was resolved by generating a GitHub personal access token and configuring Prefect with the required permissions. Second, the pipeline code was originally structured to run from a local file path on a single machine, which is not compatible with automated, repeatable execution. This was resolved by configuring the Prefect flow to pull the pipeline code directly from the GitHub repository at runtime, decoupling execution from any single local environment.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1821 0 R
>>
endobj
